# Screenity - Screen Recorder & Annotation Tool
# 
# Screenity - 屏幕录像和标注工具
#. Extension name
msgid "extName"
msgstr "Screenity - 屏幕錄像和標註工具"

# The free and privacy-friendly screen recorder with no limits. Capture, annotate, edit videos and more - all with no sign in needed.
# 
# 最佳免费无限制屏幕录制工具。捕捉、标注、缩放、模糊、编辑视频等功能 - 无需登录，保护隐私。
#. Extension description
msgid "extDesc"
msgstr "最佳的免費屏幕錄製工具，無任何限制。捕捉、標註、縮放、模糊、編輯視頻等等 - 無需註冊，保護隱私。"

